# Plow Through, first mode: "Target creature you control fights target creature an opponent controls." Bot1's Memnite and Bot2's
# Memnite fight: each deals 1 damage to the other and both die. The first target must be Bot1's: Bot2's Memnite is refused
# there, and Bot1's own Ornithopter is refused for the second, which must be an opponent's creature (the refusals).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Memnite
Ornithopter
Plow Through
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Plow Through.Cast
Bot1.Modes(fights)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Emerald; Ornithopter
Bot1.Graveyard = Memnite; Plow Through
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
